### Hello World
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### ─── Transactions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create — transfer between accounts
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-00001",
  "toAccount": "ACC-00002",
  "amount": 251.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

###

### Create — deposit into account
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-00001",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### Create — withdrawal from account
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-00001",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

###

### Create — 400: negative amount
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-00001",
  "toAccount": "ACC-00002",
  "amount": -50.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

###

### Create — 400: too many decimal places
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-00001",
  "amount": 100.123,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### Create — 400: invalid account format
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "123",
  "toAccount": "ACC-00002",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

###

### Create — 400: invalid currency code
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-00001",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "currency": "FAKE",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### Create — 400: invalid type
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-00001",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "unknown"
}

###

### Create — 400: malformed JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{invalid json}

###

### List all transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

###

### Filter by accountId
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-00001

###

### Filter by type
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=transfer

###

### Filter by date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2024-06-30

###

### Filter by from date only
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=2024-04-01

###

### Filter combined: accountId + type
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-00001&type=transfer

###

### Get transaction by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}

###

### Get transaction — 404: non-existent ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/non-existent-id

###

### ─── Accounts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get balance for an active account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-00001/balance

###

### Get balance — returns empty balances for unknown account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-99999/balance

###

### Get summary for an account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-00001/summary

###

### Get summary — returns zeros for unknown account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-99999/summary

###
